    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo heedaádá' iri huúw ay baraá guruú do', didá' hhoohhoo'. Inós loohidá' baraá dó' i darah gari qoomeés, tlenaangós oo baraay a miíta tám, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee intlaxweemaawós a miíta kooán nee loohidá' umuú bihhiiwo i koo/ír koón, nee koo/idá' yaangareemawo a miíta tsár nee tlaqi. Matla/aangw guri qoomeés tlenaangós a miíta mibeeri tsár nee intlaxweemaawós a miíta mibaangw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo iri dáh baraá kutuwidár baraá guruú do'. Loohidá' aa baraá guruú dó' i dat gari qoomeés, tlenaango a miíta wak nee intlaxweemaawós a miíta tám nee tlaqi. Koo/idár bihhér loohi a miíta tám nee tlaqi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutuwidá' gari qoomeés, bihhe sleémeero i alqoón, bihheerós a miíta mibaangw. Kutuwirí i geeraá didá' hhoohhoo'. Aluuwo aníng iri báy, «Diirí an didá' ló'wa hhoohhoo'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heedaádá' yaangareemaá koo/iidár Doó Mungú giri qoomeés naxés a miíta tám. Maraá ninakw awa Doó Mungú ngwa harweeriye' i dayá', umuú do'o yaangareemaawo a miíta tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Marayká' a adór maraá taa tleéhh gawaá daanduú kuqá' mari tám, nee umuú do'o kutuwáy ngu kon a mibeeri tám. Koo/ír Doó Mungú ar gawaá do'oduú gawa ka algeé niina ta ak tidár do'oduú baraá hará', as Doó Mungú munguwa al'iloouyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bartakaaro, koo/idár Doó Mungú bara xuuxú' tsee/aá wa alé, yaangareemawo i alqoná' iimír baráy wa tleemu ay gawa. Tsee/aá Doó Munguhe nee tsee/aá kutuwaywo tsa/aa/amto tsár i deer, tidá' tar gáwtí tsa/aa/an amór do'oda' gáwtí dirií'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy ngiri ár, naxés Doó Mungú i sakaáfu taa gáwtí tleés kón oo gwaa harweer, sakaáfuudá' an dír iihhafiirír maraydá' gáwtí diriiá' awa tám kay tleéhh, kudaá afiqoomár Doó Mungú, tlenángw saweemaá iihhafiirirós i qoná' nee pa/almooduú qoomeemes, oo miíta tám. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaangareemaá koo/idár tsee/aá kutuwaydá' a miíta tsár nee tlaqi. Tsirxaadár tla/ángw kutuwayduú bihhe kudá' nee Doó Mungú ti ga/aawá', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee kutuwayduú xuumuuse intlaxweemaawós a miíta mibaangw, Doó Mungú guna harweér. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutuwayduú bihhe afer'ín kaa gweér amór afeeni, afkú wák i bihhaá /iya, nee oo hatlá' i bihhaá basa. Nee iihhafiiridá' taa haragaás nee afeenidá' uroó bihheero a miíta tsár nee tlaqi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alhhe'eesoó kilá' oo afeenidá' bihhaá /uwaawo doó tleerantleér oo tlenaango miíta mibeeri tsiyáhh nee kooán, nee intlaxweemaawo a miíta mibeeri tám nee kooán i deer. Koo/irós yaangareemaawo a miíta tsár nee tlaqi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heedaádá' bihhaá tsee/a awa Doó Mungú giri qoomeés nee tlenangw'ín a miíta mibeeri kooán. Iimír alaá Doó Mungú ay tsirxaadá' tar waraahhi ay alhhe'eesoó tsirxaadá', bihhaá /uwa sleeme aqo miíta mibeeri kooán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlenángw geeraá Doó Mungú iimír bihhaaká' ay kuqá' bira dinkwaárií haraafát nee tsirxaduudá' taa geexáy, a miíta mibeeri kooán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heedaádá' tlenángw do'odá' guna qoomeés ay bihhaá /uwa dinkwa nee gar/aawedár bihhe sleémeero, tlenaangós a miíta mibeeri kooán.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutuwidá' tar daraahi baraá Doó Mungú i ale, didá' hhoohhoo' nee didá' ak ló'wa hhoohhoo', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sleémeero kana qaalín ar peehháy iimír baraá yaamuú wa alé ay har afiqoomoó pa/eeri. Pa/eeriiká' tuuntukaro ki aleesláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afkú do'o bihhaá gawa kin qaalín nee tam guruú kutuwi nee daanduú tsee/a oo kutuwidá' kina qaalín, koo/i sleémeero ar kutuwidár guruú do' kina qaalín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slaqsa'aá keruúbi nee awa slaansla kina gawaá koo/írí tleéhh, slaqsi'iidaá slaansla kina tla/a slahhán nee kudaá keruúbi, kiri kutuwírár harweér. Umuú kerubumoowo gitsee/a ngi kon a tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gitse/aá hee i amór slaqsoó slaanslír ga/ayá' bartá wake, nee gitse/aá diraangw i amór slaqsoó slaanslír hatlá' ga/ayá', adoorí an adór do' sleémeero kura parootuús. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimír baráy wa tleemu ay gawa, slaqsi'iidaá keruúbi nee awa slaansla kina dó'ar parootuús. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maanda nee duxuutér didá' hhoohhoo' i alqoná'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dír geeraá afkuduú dahamaá didá' ló'wa hhoohhooe garkar ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "adór kitángw ilahhooa oo taa tleéhh ar peehháy i deer. Tlenaangós a tlaqtá miíta nee bihheerós a miíta wak, xareemiiwós iwitanangós nee bihheerós sleémeero kina tleéhh ar peehháy. Heedaádá' aníng iri báy, «Gaarí an meésadá' hoot dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa ale.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afkuko i deer oo dahamaá baraá matla/ángw Doó Mungú nee afkú hatlá' oo dahamaá didá' ló'wa hhoohhoo'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
